usage: corpus-nav.py graph [-h] [--json] [--limit TOP] [--bare]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --json                emit {nodes, forward, reverse, dangling, stats} as
                        JSON
  --limit, --top, -n TOP
                        most-cited blocks to list in the summary (default: 10;
                        --top is the old name)
  --bare                also count bare B<N> mentions (outside code) of
                        existing blocks as citations
